DESCRIPTION:
During the aseptic crystallization and vacuum drying of Meropenem Sterile API Batch MPN-26-304, visual monitoring recorded visible white particulate matter in the supernatant wash solution. In addition, moisture content Karl Fischer titration yielded 14.8% (validated spec: 11.4% - 13.4%). Differential pressure across the HEPA supply boundary in LYO-03 dropped from 22 Pa to 6 Pa.

IMMEDIATE ACTION TAKEN:
Batch MPN-26-304 quarantined immediately in cold storage chamber CS-02 at 2-8 deg C. Aseptic processing line LYO-03 shut down and tagged out for cleanroom integrity re-certification.
